  m_text: "Long press the \"SPIN button\" to set the number of rounds for automatic
    rotation, or automatic continuous execution of bets. Click the \"Rotate\" button
    to start auto play. Click Stop to interrupt the automatic rotation.\nDuring automatic
    rotation, the remaining number of rotations will be displayed on the screen.
    \u221E means unlimited automatic rotation."
